@startuml UC001_Login_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC001 — Email and password sign-in

actor Browser
participant "src/server.js" as Server
participant "src/routes/auth.routes.js" as Routes
participant "src/services/authService.js" as Auth
participant "src/services/tokenService.js" as Tokens
participant "src/middleware/requireAuth.js" as Guard
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Browser -> Server : POST /api/login
Server -> Routes : Dispatch to login route
Routes -> Auth : loginUser(email, password)
Auth -> Data : findUserByEmail()
Data -> DB : Read account and password hash
Data --> Auth : Account and hash
Auth -> Auth : Verify password and start session
Auth -> Tokens : Generate and hash refresh token
Tokens --> Auth : Refresh token and hash
Auth -> Data : insertSession()
Data -> DB : Save session and refresh token hash
Auth --> Routes : Session and refresh token
Routes -> Tokens : signAccessToken()
Tokens --> Routes : Signed access token
Routes --> Browser : 200 OK with access token and refresh cookie

== Follow-up request for the signed-in account ==

Browser -> Server : GET /api/me with Bearer token
Server -> Routes : Dispatch to protected route
Routes -> Guard : Check access
Guard -> Tokens : verifyAccessToken()
Tokens --> Guard : Account ID and session ID
Guard -> Data : findActiveSessionUser()
Data -> DB : Read account for active session
Data --> Guard : Account details
Guard --> Routes : Set req.user and continue
Routes --> Browser : 200 OK with account details
@enduml
